1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,407
Every day, Nigerians travel roads we know are risky. Who warns you — before you enter?

2
00:00:12,857 --> 00:00:28,242
SafeAlert shows community reports — live. Your people. Not government.

3
00:00:28,692 --> 00:00:39,491
Hold SOS 3 seconds. Circle gets live location — instantly.

4
00:00:39,942 --> 00:00:53,309
Estate join code → all neighbors alerted on panic.

5
00:00:53,759 --> 00:01:05,159
Neighbor taps “I’m on my way.” Help is coming.

6
00:01:05,609 --> 00:01:18,065
Report · confirm · share. Built for low data.

7
00:01:18,515 --> 00:01:30,113
SafeAlert NG — free. Add your circle before the next journey.
